    {
      "id": "P0STBL61",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -318.51538878808714,
      "y": 5228.645690700796,
      "width": 311.6996312028465,
      "height": 262.4614315617466,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebf0f4",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "-0dRTGAgj-Vf_6MVxSjh0"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bOf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 446492941,
      "version": 2044,
      "versionNonce": 1250784131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774835757396,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Other Key points\n- To register a new Schema:\n   \"Subject Name\" & \"Actual Schema\"\n- Subject Name: \n      - topic_Name & Key \n      - topic_Name & Value\n- OnSucces it has: Schema Id, Schema Versions\n- Topic level compatibility\n- To Get schema: SubjectName & version\n- Subject Name Strategies:\n     - TopicNameStrategy (Default)\n         (e.g)TopicA-value,topicB-key\n     - RecordNameStrategy\n         (e.g) io.cflt.purchase\n     - TopicRecordNameStrategy\n         (e.g) TopicA-io.cflt.Purchase",
      "fontSize": 13.12307157808733,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Other Key points\n- To register a new Schema:\n   \"Subject Name\" & \"Actual Schema\"\n- Subject Name: \n      - topic_Name & Key \n      - topic_Name & Value\n- OnSucces it has: Schema Id, Schema Versions\n- Topic level compatibility\n- To Get schema: SubjectName & version\n- Subject Name Strategies:\n     - TopicNameStrategy (Default)\n         (e.g)TopicA-value,topicB-key\n     - RecordNameStrategy\n         (e.g) io.cflt.purchase\n     - TopicRecordNameStrategy\n         (e.g) TopicA-io.cflt.Purchase",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
