    {
      "id": "2Y1xF4do",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2671.1200263470078,
      "y": 4930.662205059874,
      "width": 595.061767578125,
      "height": 240.56133540953027,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bRT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 618130573,
      "version": 1706,
      "versionNonce": 229233635,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1774836048362,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OTHER KEY POINTS\n - Connector plugins , Confluent Hub ,Atleast once, Exactly once\n - Self Managed Connect,Fully Managed Connect ( UI, Elastic Scaling).\n - (1* connect clusters, Each run 1* connect workers)\n - Connector Instance, Connect Record, SMT, Converter\n - REST API, 3 topics, Workers, Tasks, ( JVM),\n - Parallelism is done thorugh tasks. Tasks is the number of\n  threads for a single connector\n-  Deployment Standalone (File for state), Distributed (kafka topics)\n- SMT : to be used for simple stateless transformation like \n data-masking, column hiding and not for Fraud detection",
      "fontSize": 17.49536984796584,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OTHER KEY POINTS\n - Connector plugins , Confluent Hub ,Atleast once, Exactly once\n - Self Managed Connect,Fully Managed Connect ( UI, Elastic Scaling).\n - (1* connect clusters, Each run 1* connect workers)\n - Connector Instance, Connect Record, SMT, Converter\n - REST API, 3 topics, Workers, Tasks, ( JVM),\n - Parallelism is done thorugh tasks. Tasks is the number of\n  threads for a single connector\n-  Deployment Standalone (File for state), Distributed (kafka topics)\n- SMT : to be used for simple stateless transformation like \n data-masking, column hiding and not for Fraud detection",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
