    {
      "id": "KK_4Ht51ATxPg00riyrww",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040.1941007705182,
      "y": 451.1044896087901,
      "width": 484.31964111328125,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bTY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 792427820,
      "version": 529,
      "versionNonce": 1070925100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781632173166,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Online Algorithms\n\nAn online algorithm is an algorithm that:\n\n\n- Processes data as it arrives, continuous\ncomputation\n- Does NOT know future data upfront\n- Maintains a running result/state\n- Makes decisions based only on data seen so far",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "pjpy5i4Ekpu_UzmAHCBTR",
      "originalText": "Online Algorithms\n\nAn online algorithm is an algorithm that:\n\n\n- Processes data as it arrives, continuous computation\n- Does NOT know future data upfront\n- Maintains a running result/state\n- Makes decisions based only on data seen so far",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ivzWGmDAb1nAe-0Isy-1z",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2639.2389069314086,
      "y": 856.8108309307263,
      "width": 501.2599027879437,
      "height": 185,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
