      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781632177247,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Associativity \n     Order of grouping does not matter\n     (a+b) +c = a + ( b+c)\n2. Commutavity\n     Order does not matter\n     e.g a+b = b+a\n3.  Identity Element\n       A neutral value doesnt change other elements\n4.  Idempotence\n       Applying operation twice gives same result.\n       e.g. max(3,3) =3 ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "42WVMvONzhOPWFYCcrzkx",
      "originalText": "1. Associativity \n     Order of grouping does not matter\n     (a+b) +c = a + ( b+c)\n2. Commutavity\n     Order does not matter\n     e.g a+b = b+a\n3.  Identity Element\n       A neutral value doesnt change other elements\n4.  Idempotence\n       Applying operation twice gives same result.\n       e.g. max(3,3) =3 ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
