      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Datacenter ---> 1..* AZs\n1 AZ ---> 0..* Kafka cluster\n1 Kafka cluster ---> 1..* kafka broker\n1 kafka broker ---> 1..* kafka topics\n1 kafka topic --->  1..* kafka partitions\n1 kafka partiton ---> 1..* segment files\n1 segment files --->  1..* kafka record",
